                <h1 id="platform-modules">Platform > Modules</h1>

    

                                <h2 id="platform-modules-GETapi-v1-admin-modules-organizations">Who has what — the list an administrator assigning a module starts from.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Counts are computed in PHP over the page rather than in SQL, because
"has this module" is three conditions (enabled, started, unexpired) and
ModuleAccess is the one place allowed to decide them. A COUNT(*) here
would be a fourth opinion, and the first one to drift.</p>

<span id="example-requests-GETapi-v1-admin-modules-organizations">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


