                <h1 id="platform-messaging-settings">Platform > Messaging Settings</h1>

    

                                <h2 id="platform-messaging-settings-GETapi-v1-admin-messaging--channel-">What is configured, and what is still missing.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Returns the SHAPE of the credentials and never their contents. A secret
comes back as <code>is_set: true</code> and nothing more — an administrator needs
to know whether a token is present, not what it is, and a secret that
reaches the browser is a secret in somebody's devtools and browser cache.</p>

