                    <h2 id="tenant-dashboard-GETapi-v1-tenant-dashboard--panel-">One card, re-asked with its own filter — the revenue chart by week,
the visit chart for one branch, last year&#039;s profit and loss.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Its own endpoint rather than parameters on index(): changing one card's
filter must not recompute every other card on the screen.</p>
<p>A panel this person may not see answers 404, exactly as one that does
not exist would. A branch they may not see is refused outright.</p>

<span id="example-requests-GETapi-v1-tenant-dashboard--panel-">
