                    <h2 id="tenant-users-roles-permissions-PUTapi-v1-tenant-users--user_id--branches">Where somebody works — the whole set, replaced in one write.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Separate from <code>update</code>, which is about who they are. Moving somebody
between branches is organization-level work, and folding it into the
ordinary edit would have handed it to every branch manager holding
<code>people.edit</code>.</p>

<span id="example-requests-PUTapi-v1-tenant-users--user_id--branches">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
