                    <h2 id="tenant-users-roles-permissions-GETapi-v1-tenant-roles-templates">Somewhere to start, when writing a role.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>The same library the seeder uses, so what an owner is offered here and
what a new organization is given on day one cannot drift apart. It used
to live in the front-end bundle, which meant two lists that agreed only
as long as somebody remembered to edit both.</p>
<p>Narrowed to what is grantable WHERE THIS PERSON IS, for the same reason
<code>grantable()</code> is: a branch writing its own roles can only draw on what
