                    <h2 id="tenant-customers-GETapi-v1-tenant-customers--customer_id--visits">Everything that has happened to this patient, and what it adds up to.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Appointments and what was written up at each, together — they are read
as one thing ("what happened on the 12th"), and separating them would
mean a screen joining two lists by date to put them back.</p>
<p>The summary beside them is derived from the same rows rather than stored:
a "total visits" column would be a number that drifts the first time an
appointment is cancelled.</p>

