                    <h2 id="tenant-appointments-opd-GETapi-v1-tenant-opd-my-records">A doctor&#039;s own records — one endpoint, several readings.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>The screens ask the same question of the same rows from different
angles, and splitting them into a route each would be that many places
to keep the doctor check and the date window in step.</p>
<p><code>q</code> narrows the patient list only; the others are windows of time.</p>

<span id="example-requests-GETapi-v1-tenant-opd-my-records">
