                    <h2 id="tenant-appointments-opd-PUTapi-v1-tenant-appointments--appointment_id--consultation">Write it, or write over it.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>One row per visit, so this is an upsert rather than a create: a doctor
adding a diagnosis after the prescription is editing the same
consultation, not starting a second one.</p>

