                    <h2 id="tenant-appointments-opd-POSTapi-v1-tenant-appointments--appointment_id--consultation-start">Take the patient in.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Refused unless reception has called them, refused if it is already
under way, and refused if it has already been completed — each with a
sentence saying which, because "cannot start" tells a doctor with a
patient in front of them nothing.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-v1-tenant-appointments--appointment_id--consultation-start">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tenant/appointments/16/consultation/start" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_SANCTUM_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json"</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
    <pre><code class="language-javascript">const url = new URL(
    "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tenant/appointments/16/consultation/start"
);

const headers = {
    "Authorization": "Bearer {YOUR_SANCTUM_TOKEN}",
    "Content-Type": "application/json",
    "Accept": "application/json",
};


fetch(url, {
