                    <h2 id="tenant-appointments-opd-POSTapi-v1-tenant-appointments--appointment_id--consultation-complete">Finished — and the visit is not, unless nothing came of it.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

