                    <h2 id="tenant-appointments-opd-POSTapi-v1-tenant-appointments--appointment_id--consultation-reopen">Put a finished visit back in the room — today&#039;s only.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Behind <code>appointments.consult_complete</code>, so whoever may close a
consultation may reopen one and nobody else can. It used to sit with
the desk's queue capability, which meant a receptionist could reopen a
