                    <h2 id="tenant-laboratory-GETapi-v1-tenant-lab-orders">The worklist, at the branches the caller works at.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p><code>outstanding=1</code> is the technician's default view: everything ordered or
in hand, and nothing signed off. Two statuses rather than one, which a
plain <code>status=</code> filter cannot express — and the distinction matters,
because an order somebody is already working is not one to pick up.</p>

