                    <h2 id="tenant-pharmacy-medicines-GETapi-v1-tenant-pharmacy-stores--store_id--categories">The categories this store actually stocks.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Scoped to the store rather than the whole catalogue: a counter's chips
should not offer "Veterinary" to a shop that has never carried any, and
a chip that always returns nothing is a chip people learn to distrust.</p>
<p>Its own endpoint because the list is not page-scoped — it has to describe
the whole shelf, not the eight items currently on screen.</p>

