                    <h2 id="tenant-pharmacy-stores-sales-POSTapi-v1-tenant-sales--sale_id--payments">Take money against a bill left owing — at this counter, not at Billing.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Whoever may sell or dispense here may collect: the person at the till.
A repeated Idempotency-Key answers 200 with the bill as it stands.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-v1-tenant-sales--sale_id--payments">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tenant/sales/16/payments" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_SANCTUM_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"idempotency_key\": \"b\",
    \"tenders\": [
        {
            \"method\": \"architecto\",
            \"amount\": 22,
            \"reference\": \"g\"
        }
    ]
}"
</code></pre></div>


