                    <h2 id="tenant-billing-GETapi-v1-tenant-billing-overview-outstanding-summary">The outstanding register&#039;s own cards — unpaid against partially paid.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>The date range is optional here, unlike every other window on this
controller: outstanding money does not age out just because it falls
off the front of a range, so the figures are all-time unless the
screen's own filter actually narrows them.</p>

<span id="example-requests-GETapi-v1-tenant-billing-overview-outstanding-summary">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request GET \
    --get "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tenant/billing/overview/outstanding/summary" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_SANCTUM_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"from\": \"2026-10-16T00:41:36\",
    \"to\": \"2052-11-08\"
}"
</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
