                    <h2 id="tenant-billing-POSTapi-v1-tenant-invoices-bill-visit">The OPD&#039;s bill for a visit, drawn now at the desk.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>For the <code>manual</code>-timing organisation, and for the visit whose timing
passed with nothing priced. OPD charges only — the doctor's fee and the
per-visit charges; the lab bills its own orders and the pharmacy its
own sales. Answers with the visit's bill if it already has one.</p>

