                    <h2 id="tenant-billing-POSTapi-v1-tenant-invoices--invoice_id--payments">Record a payment against an invoice.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>One tender (<code>method</code>, <code>amount</code>) or several (<code>tenders[]</code>) — a bill
settled ₹300 cash and ₹200 UPI is one collection, which is what lets a
clinic that takes bills in full still take that one.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-v1-tenant-invoices--invoice_id--payments">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
