                    <h2 id="tenant-patient-documents-GETapi-v1-tenant-document-templates">Templates for one place.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p><code>location_id</code> in the query says which branch; absent means the caller's
own. An organization administrator may ask about any branch; anybody
else is held to theirs — and the answer always includes the
organization's defaults, because that is what they actually print with
where they have not customised.</p>

