                    <h2 id="tenant-patient-documents-PUTapi-v1-tenant-document-templates--id-">Save the draft.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Writes to the unpublished version, creating one when the last is
published. Never touches a published version: it is what somebody's
printed document was made from.</p>

