                    <h2 id="tenant-patient-documents-POSTapi-v1-tenant-document-templates-preview">A PDF of what is on screen — rendered, never stored.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Takes the config from the REQUEST rather than the record, so somebody
editing sees what they are typing. Sample values, never a real patient:
a preview of a medical document carrying somebody's actual name would be
the one thing it must not be.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-v1-tenant-document-templates-preview">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tenant/document-templates/preview" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_SANCTUM_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"document_type\": \"architecto\",
    \"config\": [],
    \"location_id\": 16
}"
</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
