                    <h2 id="tenant-communications-automation-POSTapi-v1-tenant-communication-campaigns--campaign_id--schedule">Set the time, and let it go by itself.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>The time must be in the future: a campaign scheduled for this morning
would be picked up on the dispatcher's very next run and go out
immediately, which is never what somebody choosing a past time meant.</p>

