                    <h2 id="tenant-communications-automation-DELETEapi-v1-tenant-communication-campaigns--id-">Remove a campaign, and its recipients with it.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>The database cascade never fires, because this is a soft delete and the
row stays — so the children are taken explicitly. The delivery log is
left alone on purpose: what actually reached a patient is evidence, and
removing the campaign that sent it does not unsend it.</p>

<span id="example-requests-DELETEapi-v1-tenant-communication-campaigns--id-">
